---
// src/pages/docs/demo.astro — Five-flow demo walkthrough
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Demo Walkthrough" activeNav="docs">
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: calc(64px + var(--space-2xl));">
    <div class="container-narrow">

      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/docs">Docs</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb-sep">/</span>
        <span class="breadcrumb-current">Demo Walkthrough</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="demo-header">
        <span class="badge badge-green">Live on K3s</span>
        <h1>ICN Demo: Five Cooperative Flows</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Five cooperatives running on a real Kubernetes cluster.
          Five end-to-end flows covering governance, economics, federation, reporting, and compute.
          Each flow issues cryptographic receipts — not mocked, not simulated.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Prerequisites -->
      <div class="prereq-box">
        <h4>Prerequisites</h4>
        <p>kubectl access to the K3s cluster. Run <code>demo/scripts/reseed-federation-demo.sh</code> before any demo day to seed identity, trust, and state.</p>
        <p>Each flow accepts <code>--present</code> (minimal output, pause on key beats) or <code>--narrated</code> (full explanatory output) flags.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Flow 1 -->
      <div class="flow-card">
        <div class="flow-header">
          <div class="flow-num">1</div>
          <div class="flow-meta">
            <h2>Cooperative Governance</h2>
            <span class="flow-coop">Brightworks Collective</span>
          </div>
          <span class="badge badge-green">~8 min</span>
        </div>
        <p>
          A member proposes expanding the cooperative's digital services mandate. The full governance loop runs:
          proposal submission, member voting, tally, and outcome — each step producing a verifiable receipt.
        </p>
        <div class="flow-proves">
          <span class="flow-proves-label">Proves:</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">Proposal lifecycle</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">Democratic vote</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">GovernanceReceipt</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">decision_hash provenance</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="flow-cmd"><code>bash demo/scripts/flow-1-governance.sh [--present | --narrated]</code></pre>
      </div>

      <!-- Flow 2 -->
      <div class="flow-card">
        <div class="flow-header">
          <div class="flow-num">2</div>
          <div class="flow-meta">
            <h2>Patronage Settlement</h2>
            <span class="flow-coop">Brightworks Collective</span>
          </div>
          <span class="badge badge-green">~10 min</span>
        </div>
        <p>
          After a governance decision, the cooperative distributes patronage dividends to members.
          The settlement is anchored to the governance receipt via <code>decision_hash</code> — proving
          the economic outcome flows directly from the democratic decision.
        </p>
        <div class="flow-proves">
          <span class="flow-proves-label">Proves:</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">Patronage allocation</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">Settlement receipt</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">Governance → ledger provenance</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="flow-cmd"><code>bash demo/scripts/flow-2-patronage.sh [--present | --narrated]</code></pre>
      </div>

      <!-- Flow 3 -->
      <div class="flow-card">
        <div class="flow-header">
          <div class="flow-num">3</div>
          <div class="flow-meta">
            <h2>Clearinghouse &amp; Mutual Credit</h2>
            <span class="flow-coop">Rochester Cooperative Clearinghouse</span>
          </div>
          <span class="badge badge-green">~8 min</span>
        </div>
        <p>
          The clearinghouse cooperative records treasury activity across member organizations.
          Mutual credit positions, ledger entries, and cross-cooperative clearing are demonstrated
          without a central bank or settlement authority.
        </p>
        <div class="flow-proves">
          <span class="flow-proves-label">Proves:</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">Mutual credit ledger</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">Cross-coop clearing</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">Treasury position</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="flow-cmd"><code>bash demo/scripts/flow-3-clearinghouse.sh [--present | --narrated]</code></pre>
      </div>

      <!-- Flow 4 -->
      <div class="flow-card">
        <div class="flow-header">
          <div class="flow-num">4</div>
          <div class="flow-meta">
            <h2>Regulatory Reporting</h2>
            <span class="flow-coop">Harbor Freight Workers Cooperative</span>
          </div>
          <span class="badge badge-green">~8 min</span>
        </div>
        <p>
          Harbor generates a signed compliance report over its transaction history.
          The report is anchored to on-chain governance receipts, enabling third-party
          verification without exposing internal financials.
        </p>
        <div class="flow-proves">
          <span class="flow-proves-label">Proves:</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">Report generation</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">Transaction audit trail</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">Signed governance anchor</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="flow-cmd"><code>bash demo/scripts/flow-4-reporting.sh [--present | --narrated]</code></pre>
      </div>

      <!-- Flow 5 -->
      <div class="flow-card flow-card-compute">
        <div class="flow-header">
          <div class="flow-num flow-num-c">5</div>
          <div class="flow-meta">
            <h2>Commons Compute</h2>
            <span class="flow-coop">Finger Lakes CDN</span>
          </div>
          <span class="badge badge-purple">~5 min</span>
        </div>
        <p>
          Finger Lakes CDN submits a compute task to the commons pool. Two gates are enforced
          before admission: a <code>compute:write</code> scope check on the capability token, and
          a trust score check against the commons admission threshold (<code>MIN_TRUST_SUBMIT = 0.1</code>).
          Both pass. The task enters the queue with a Blake3 content hash as its provenance anchor.
        </p>
        <div class="status-note">
          <strong>Sprint 28 complete:</strong> Gossip fan-out fix enables task dispatch via
          loopback. CCL executor is live. Tasks move Pending → Completed. Settlement receipts
          with full provenance chain are generated on completion.
        </div>
        <div class="flow-proves">
          <span class="flow-proves-label">Proves:</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">Trust-gated admission</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">compute:write scope</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">Ledger position query</span>
          <span class="tech-pill">Authorization boundary</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="flow-cmd"><code>bash demo/scripts/flow-5-compute.sh [--present | --narrated]</code></pre>
      </div>

      <!-- What comes next -->
      <div class="next-section">
        <h2>What Comes Next</h2>
        <div class="next-grid">
          <div class="next-item">
            <span class="next-label">Distributed Execution</span>
            <p>Multi-executor node pool scaling across K3s cluster. Tasks already execute via gossip loopback; this expands to parallel execution across cooperative-contributed nodes.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="next-item">
            <span class="next-label">Mobile UX</span>
            <p>Member-facing PWA for governance participation, patronage tracking, and cooperative membership management.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="next-item">
            <span class="next-label">Federation Treaties</span>
            <p>Formal inter-cooperative agreements with treaty-based governance and mutual credit clearing across organizations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="doc-footer">
        <a href="/docs" class="btn btn-ghost">← Back to Docs</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/InterCooperative-Network/icn/tree/main/demo" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">View Scripts on GitHub →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .breadcrumb a { color: var(--accent-teal); }
  .breadcrumb-sep { color: var(--text-muted); }
  .breadcrumb-current { color: var(--text-primary); }

  .demo-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .demo-header h1 { margin: 0; }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .prereq-box {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-amber);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .prereq-box h4 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--accent-amber);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .prereq-box p {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .prereq-box p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .flow-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .flow-card-compute {
    border-color: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.3);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-card), rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.04));
  }

  .flow-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .flow-num {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.12);
    color: var(--accent-teal);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .flow-num-c {
    background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.12);
    color: var(--accent-purple);
  }

  .flow-meta {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .flow-meta h2 {
    margin: 0 0 2px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .flow-coop {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .flow-card > p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .status-note {
    background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .status-note strong { color: var(--accent-purple); }

  .flow-proves {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .flow-proves-label {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .tech-pill {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.2em 0.6em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .flow-cmd {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg-code);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .next-section {
    margin: var(--space-3xl) 0 var(--space-2xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-2xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .next-section h2 { margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); }

  .next-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .next-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .next-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent-teal);
  }

  .next-item p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .doc-footer {
    margin-top: var(--space-3xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .flow-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .next-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
